            "text_dCxNMj": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>New Jersey MLS NEXT Pro is built for this community. Middlesex County is one of the most diverse and soccer-passionate regions in the country, and this club intends to reflect that from day one.</p><p>In 2027, New York City FC Youth Programs will establish a Regional Hub at NEXUS, bringing the club's world-class player development coaching and methodology to Middlesex County. Programming will serve kids ages three to eighteen, based at the state-of-the-art soccer fields adjacent to the stadium.</p><p>Players who come through the Regional Hub will have direct exposure to New York City FC's professional development pathway, creating a pipeline from local youth soccer all the way to professional play.</p><p>Want to get involved or stay up to date on youth programming?</p>",
